    <string name="free_models">Free models</string>
    <string name="free_models_detail">Use the app without paying: %1$d providers with a free tier</string>
    <string name="free_disclaimer_title">Free, with real limits</string>
    <string name="free_disclaimer_body">Free tiers are for trying things out, not for working. They answer worse than paid models and have per-minute and per-day limits that an agent goal or a scheduled task burns through fast. Among these providers only Gemini sees images; only Groq transcribes audio; image generation and read-aloud are free nowhere, so those features stay off. Tool calling is uneven, so the agent and connectors may misfire. None of these endpoints works without a credential: what is free is the sign-up, not the key — and where marked, your prompts are used to train the models.</string>
