    <string name="catalog_oauth_note">How the browser sign-in works: GUZZOBOT asks the connector who authorizes it, registers itself with that service, and sends you to its sign-in page. On the way back the code is exchanged for a token that stays encrypted on the phone and renews itself when it expires. We never see your password. If a service does not allow automatic client registration, the app says so instead of failing silently.</string>
